  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please adjust the fist gesture on index so that when you are just holding the controller the gesture is Idle, but when the GestureWeight is > 0, it switches to the Fist gesture. Currently, there are a lot of avatars that work fine for other players, but not Index users. This is because 3.0 avatars typically just replace the slots of the avatar for the gestures, and on Index, the Fist gesture is triggered before any trigger pressure is used, even though on oculus it wont trigger until you start pressing on the trigger. This behavior is different from that of other controllers and makes it uncomfortable to hold the controller in some sort of idle or mid-open hand or other gesture to prevent the fist gesture's activation",
